  "summary": "opam vulnerability",
  "details": "Andrew Nesbitt discovered that opam did not properly validate file\ndestination paths in package install files. An attacker could use this\nissue to bypass sandbox protections and write files to arbitrary locations,\npossibly leading to arbitrary code execution.",
